:: Hopeless Cycle Ending C 3 [ending]
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>
<<run Time.timeTravel(new DateTime(1390, 8, 3, 12, 30))>>
<<set Weather.set("heavyPrecipitation", true, 600)>>
<<set $trauma to 5000>><<set $stress to 0>><<set $control to 1000>><<set $purity to 500>><<set $arousal to 7000>><<set $pleasure to 5000>>
<<set $player.virginity.penile to $prisoner.name>><<set $player.virginity.temple to false>>
<<canvas-model-override "arm_left" "none">><<canvas-model-override "arm_right" "none">>
<<set _witchClothes to $hcItems.find(clothes => clothes.type is "clothes" and clothes.location is "prisoner")?.name>>
<<hopelessCycleBrandings>>

<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairBlooms")>>
	<<set $hc.witchHair to "hair-flowers">>
<<elseif $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHair")>>
	<<set $hc.witchHair to "hair-braid">>
<<elseif $prisonerEvents.includes("washHair")>>
	<<set $hc.witchHair to "hair-clean">>
<<else>>
	<<set $hc.witchHair to "hair-dirty">>
<</if>>

<<if $prisoner.bandagesOn>>
	<<set _bandages to "bandages-alt">>
<</if>>
<<if _witchClothes is "robe">>
	<<set _clothes to "robe-alt">>
<<elseif _witchClothes is "bloodstained sack" or _witchClothes is "torn vegetable sack">>
	<<set _clothes to "sack-alt">>
<</if>>
<<if _brandings.chest>>
	<<set _brandings.chest to "brand-chest-alt">>
<</if>>
<<if _brandings.right_arm>>
	<<set _brandings.right_arm to "brand-right-arm-alt">>
<</if>>

<<set $follower to {
	name: "witchprisoner",
	base: "base-alt",
	left_arm: "left-arm-alt",
	clothes: _clothes,
	under_clothes: _bandages,
	hair: $hc.witchHair,
	writing_right_cheek: _brandings.right_cheek,
	writing_chest: _brandings.chest,
	writing_right_arm: _brandings.right_arm,
	writing_right_shoulder: _brandings.right_shoulder,
	writing_right_thigh: _brandings.right_thigh,
	writing_right_leg: _brandings.right_leg,
	writing_right_foot: _brandings.right_foot
}>>
<span class="narration">
	Originally, the temple had planned to make an example of the witch. Now, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> had proven to be a useful tool to them.
	<br><br>

	The Gaoler and the Hound. When a sinner's transgression was considered severe enough, they were to be thrown into a pit, where the beast and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> master eagerly awaited to execute their perverse 'justice.'
	간수의 채찍과 사냥개의 발톱은 많은 이들의 살갗에 뉘우침을 새겼다.
	<br><br>

	몇 달 동안 그들은 그 지역의 공포였다. 신도든 평신도든 사소한 죄목으로도 두 사람에게 넘겨졌다. 그들의 이름은 두려움의 대상이 되었다.
	The Hound grew affectionate for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> master, and after each punishment, they...
</span>
<br><br>

The confessors drag the sinner away to face purification. You tug on <<= $prisoner.name>>'s leash, and <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> eagerly turns to you. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> pushes <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> up with <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands as best <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> can. You lift <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> up, and carry <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> from the pit.
<br><br>

Your hands tremble. Penance always fills you with desire. Not just you, either. Juices leak from <<= $prisoner.name>>'s eager vagina. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> craves this as much as you, if not more. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eyes are locked with yours, full of hunger as <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> antler shimmers.
<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairBlooms")>>
	The flowers in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> braid have long-since withered and become dull again.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You lay <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> down on your bed. The confessors stopped giving you inspections months ago; it didn't matter anymore. You were filthy, and the two of you faced punishments of your own constantly.
<br><br>

After each punishment, briefly, you're able to make contact with <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> without that horrid feeling of weakness spreading into you. This is your only comfort. This is the only time you can enjoy each other's touch.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> wraps <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arms around you and pulls you down. Once again, you purge the filth of the sinners from each other with sins of your own. This is your justice.
<br><br>

<span class="narration">
	<<if $settings.npcPregnancyEnabled or $settings.nnpcPregnancyEnabled>>
		마침내 그들의 죄의 씨앗은 결실을 맺었다.
		<br><br>

		After many more months, the witch began to show the signs. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> belly swelled. The Gaoler's beloved Hound was treated as royalty, for a time.
		No one doubted that the gaoler was the <<worldMale 'father' 'mother'>>, but no one dared say it aloud. Regardless, their brief reign of terror came to a close.
		<br><br>

		The witch's broken body could not withstand childbirth. The moment <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> passed on, the manic haze of sadistic glee over the worshippers would fade, as if <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> had the whole flock bewitched.
		They were horrified at their own actions. The gaoler would take a vow of silence and spend the rest of <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> life repenting for <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> misdeeds.
		<br><br>

		아이는 신전에서 조심스럽게 길러졌고, 그 혈통에도 불구하고 신의 모범적인 종으로 만들어졌다.
		적어도 그들은 그렇게 생각했다. 사실 아이는 부모들만큼이나 가학적으로 자라났고, 성년이 되자 처벌을 가하는 데서 기쁨을 느꼈다.
		<br><br>

		Legend has it, the witch left this world with a smile on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face, as if this was what <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> wanted. As if <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> inhabited the body of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> own child.
		Now whole of body, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> was free to make the descendants of those who wronged <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> suffer. Eventually, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> is discovered, and once again thrown into a cell to face purification... only to seduce another worshipper, bear another child, and repeat the cycle all over again.
		Some say <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> still walks the earth to this day.
	<<else>>
		Eventually, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body could withstand no more corruption.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> began to show signs of breakdown. The Gaoler's beloved Hound was treated as royalty, for a time.
		When the end drew near, the gaoler's final charge was to return <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> ashes to the soil of the forest.
		그 일이 끝난 순간, 신도들에게서 안개가 걷힌 듯했다.
		가학적인 환희가 사라지고, 신도들은 자신들이 해 온 일에 경악했다. 마치 모두 마녀에게 홀렸던 것처럼.
		The gaoler would take a vow of silence and spend the rest of <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> life repenting for <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> misdeeds.
		<br><br>

		하지만 그것이 끝이 아니었다. 여러 해가 지난 후, 새로 입문한 수련생이 불안할 정도로 비슷한 성향을 보이기 시작했다.
		안개가 돌아왔고, 사건들은 반복되었다. 유혹당한 숭배자, 박해, 채찍과 발톱. 또다시, 그리고 또다시.
		Some say the witch's spirit continues to haunt the faithful, tempting them with sadistic urges, or outright taking their bodies to continue <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> need to inflict suffering on the descendants of those who wronged <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	그리하여 <span class="blue">파멸</span>의 절망의 굴레가 반복된다.
</span>
<<set $hc.ending to "C">>
<br><br>

