:: Hopeless Cycle Ending B [ending]
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<canvas-model-override "mouth" "neutral">>
<span class="narration">
	이 이야기의 버전에서는, 재앙이 닥치기 직전까지 의식이 지연되었다.
	<br><br>

	그들은 붉은 달이 자신들이 말하던 오염을 증식시키고 빠르게 퍼뜨린다고 믿었지만, 그 효과에 대응하는 의식을 치를 수 있는 유일한 시기이기도 했다.
</span>
<br><br>

They pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> back to the altar, now holding <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> down on top of it. The Hand approaches again, <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> face full of rage.
<br><br>

<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> brings <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> hammer up high, and strikes. You hear a sickening crunch.
<br><br>

"Stop!" the Bishop yells. The Hand does not obey. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> brings it down again. Crunch.
<br><br>

<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> does it again and again. Your siblings, all crowded around, go silent. "Stop!" the Bishop yells again, now running up to the Hand.
<br><br>

<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> finally stops. But the crackling doesn't. It sounds like an avalanche of broken glass. Your siblings begin to back away.
A few stay by the altar, entranced. You can't see <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, but you know what's happened. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s been opened.
The Bishop looks to you. "My <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>... you have damned us all."
<br><br>

제단 위, 완전무결한 고통이 세상에 구멍을 찢어 연다.
<br><br>

<<link [[목격한다|Hopeless Cycle Ending B 2]]>><</link>>
