:: Hopeless Cycle Ending B 2 [ending]
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>
<span class="narration">
	They were so eager to call <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> monster. They finally made <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> one.
</span>
<br><br>

눈 깜짝할 사이에 무리 중 네 명이 빨려 들어가고, 그들이 경계를 넘어서자 비명은 끊긴다.
가늘고 긴 검보라색 팔다리가 발판을 잡으려 하며 <span class="tentacle">구멍</span>을 넓힌다. 너무나도 작은 그 구멍을.
그들은 더 많은 당신의 형제자매들을 붙잡으려 한다. 더럽히고 싶어, 더럽힐 필요가 있어.
<br><br>

모든 나무들이 <span class="tentacle">구멍</span>을 향해 휘기 시작한다. 바람이 그 공간을 채우려는 듯 스쳐 지나간다.
<<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name).toUpperFirst()>>【이가】 마치 떠 있는 것처럼 제단에서 일어선다.
<br><br>

No, it isn't <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. It's an emptiness in a shape that was once <<worldFemale 'hers' 'his'>>. A great fissure has opened on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> chest.
<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> black heart pounds in rapturous cadence as it sees red moonlight above.
<br><br>

당신이 비명을 지르고 있는지 확실하지 않다. 모든 것이 너무 시끄럽다. 당신의 형제자매 중 일부는 도망치려 한다. <<trauma 50>><<gggtrauma>>
<br><br>

<span class="red">Four long spikes, each thrice as long as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> is tall, emerge from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> chest cavity, bending outwards and touching the ground.</span>
They resemble volcanic glass, but flexible. They push and lift <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> further. You're reminded of a spider's legs.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> limbs and head dangle limp. Two of the glassy legs stretch while the other two lift from the ground,
before they come crashing down on the opposite side, flipping <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body over. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> stiffens and trembles.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> antlers have grown, continually stretching upwards, each prong splitting into three more. The pattern of cracks covers much of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body.
어떤 곳에서는 갈라져 눈 모양으로 열린다. <span class="red">갑자기, 다리 하나가 들어 올려져 뻗어 나가,
impaling one of your fleeing siblings. It makes no noise and leaves no wound when it retracts, but <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> collapses.
그것이 꿰뚫은 것은 살이 아니었다.</span>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> head slowly raises. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> jaw hangs loose, extended and split, a purple tendril dangling from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth.
<span class="red">엘크스폰이 날카로운 포효를 내지르며 거미 같은 다리로 뛰어올라 무리를 쫓는다.</span>
<br><br>

