:: Hopeless Cycle Ending B 4 [ending]
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>
<<set $trauma to 5000>>
<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>>'s grey eye stares down at you, for a split moment. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> isn't here, though. There's nothing here. You're alone.
