<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> smiles warmly as a clawed hand comes to rest on the top of your head. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> praises you and tells you how good you've done.
You shiver in bliss. You kneel as <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> other claw cups your cheek. You don't mind how cold or sharp it is.
