<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> asks for one final gift from you. You nod your head eagerly.
<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> bends over, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face hovering just above yours.
<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> mouth opens. <span class="pink">Just as you're about to kiss, the tentacle inside <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth shoots forward into yours.</span>
It probes the inside, making you feel weak. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> presses forward, your lips finally making contact as the tentacle goes deeper.
<<takeKissVirginity $prisoner.name "romantic">><<llpurity>>
<br><br>

<<set $purity to 1>>
<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> takes nearly everything from you.
<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("love")>>
