:: Hopeless Cycle Ending A 5 [ending]
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>

<<bodyliquid "mouth" "goo" 1>>
<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> lips separate from yours, lines of glowing pink fluid connecting you for a moment.
그것은 바닥으로 뚝뚝 떨어지며, 이내 곧 메워지는 작은 <span class="tentacle">구멍</span>들을 세상에 태운다.
The tentacle retracts back into <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth, licking <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> lips as it does.
