<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("love")>>
	<span class="red">You feel cold and empty. Your heart feels still. It's nothing without <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.</span>
	You need <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> touch, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> kiss, again. You try to lean back in.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks surprised, and orders you to stop. You obey. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> studies you, in deep thought.
	<br><br>

	<span class="narration">
		The demon had everything <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> needed. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> body was stable, no longer at risk of failing.
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> could walk. The flock was helpless.
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> was free. All <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> had to do was vanish into the forest.
		<br><br>

		The transformation should have blackened <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> heart.
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> had intended to leave the gaoler behind right then, having exhausted everything <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> could from <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>.
		But something made <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> hesitate. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> stomach fluttered ever so slightly when <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> pet needily reached out to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> again.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> had nearly forgotten. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> offered <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> heart. It was a gift before <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> stole it.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looked up to the red sky. The warm nights wouldn't last.
		Someone to hold <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> at night, to take care of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>... <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> shivered with excitement. The gaoler was already so good at it.
	</span>
	<br><br>

	<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairBlooms")>>
