	<</if>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> leans in and kisses you again, without the tentacle intruding.
	<span class="green">You feel the smallest bit of warmth return to you, which doesn't fade when <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> pulls away this time.</span>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> takes your hands in <<worldFemale 'hers' 'his'>> and helps you stand.
<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hand finally releases your head. <span class="red">You fall sideways, your body entirely drained. You feel cold and empty.</span>
