<</if>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> snaps <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> fingers. The detached chain links of your armour all fly back to your body, re-weaving themselves together.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> takes your hand.
