:: Hopeless Cycle Ending S Attempt 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>
<span class="narration">
	The gaoler chose to stand by <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> side in the end. It was an outcome the witch could not have predicted.
	<br><br>

	It moved <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. Up to this point, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> affection for the gaoler was an act. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> was the key to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> freedom, and <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> did what <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> felt <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> must.
	Anything for freedom. Now? Perhaps <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> cold heart had finally found someone to sing for.
</span>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s a monstrosity. An Elkspawn. Something you never thought you'd stand beside, but your duty demands it.
<br><br>

당신들은 서로를 놓고 등을 맞댄다. 당신들은 포위되었다. 당신의 형제들이 다가온다.
<br><br>

공터는 채찍 소리, 발톱이 할퀴는 소리, 둔탁한 곤봉 소리로 가득 찬다.
<br><br>

당신들 둘 다 제 몫을 해낸다. 당신은 무장 해제와 무력화를 목표로 한다.
당신이 곤봉을 쥔 손을 치자, 곤봉이 숲 속으로 날아간다.
A <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>> crawls away after being tripped. This is still your family.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> slashes at any that dare approach. A few small cuts won't kill anyone.
An injured hand raises against <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> no more.
A <<worldFemale 'sister' 'brother'>> whose clothes fall to tatters tries to cover <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shame, leaving <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> open to being tossed aside.
<br><br>

You both have the reach to cover each other. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> long arms ward off blows aimed for your side.
A quick strike from your whip stops an attack that would otherwise hit <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head. A weapon once used to harm <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, now being used to protect <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
<br><br>

<span class="green">당신들은 붉은 달 아래에서 채찍과 발톱으로 하나가 되어 춤을 춘다.</span>
